source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A line control consumes the rest of its line and reads no second control inside it, so the heading text keeps the `bq.` visible.
-- input.jira --
* h1. bq. y
-- rendered.html --
<ul>
	<li><h1><a name="y"></a>bq. y</h1></li>
</ul>
-- want.md --
- # bq. y
-- warnings.json --
[]
